view9.layout:
Same character in exactly nine views in a 3 rows by 3 columns grid, reading order left-to-right top-to-bottom:
row1 face close-up front view facing camera, face close-up right side profile view, back-of-head close-up view no face visible;
row2 full-body front view facing camera, full-body right side profile view, full-body back view facing away no face visible;
row3 full-body high-angle shot camera looking down at the character, full-body worm's-eye extreme low-angle view camera looking up from ground level, full-body low-angle hero shot dramatic heroic upward perspective.
3:4 vertical composition, equal cells, consistent identity in every cell.
All views tile edge-to-edge seamlessly with zero gap: no white gutters, no borders, no frame lines between panels or at the outer margins; panel proportions may flex slightly so the views completely fill the image.

Same environment in nine views in a 3x3 grid:
row1 front establishing, left-front oblique into the scene, right-front oblique into the scene;
row2 left side across space, back view into environment, right side across space;
row3 left-rear oblique, right-rear oblique, aerial bird's eye plan layout architectural overview no horizon line.
3:4 vertical, distinct camera per cell.
3px pure white gutters between all panels and at the outer image margins; no thick white borders.
